      "title": "Head, tail, and wrap",
      "question": "In a fixed-size ring buffer, how do head and tail move, and how do you tell full from empty?",
      "scenes": [
        {
          "type": "question",
          "say": "Ring buffer, problem one. In a fixed-size ring buffer, how do head and tail move, and how do you tell a full buffer from an empty one? Pause and answer out loud.",
